      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MIKI BE GOOD (2) has come from wider barriers to finish fourth in his last two outings here. He is a two-time winner at this longer distance and can take advantage of the good draw. MICK DANGER (3) gets his lowest draw since he scored a win at this circuit and distance last month and he hasn't been too far away from tough barriers of late, working home to be beaten only 4m last time. FASTING (5) should find this easier than Tuesday's attempt and there was plenty of merit in the prior effort when beaten only 1.6m into third after working. PROMISING (1) has had tricky draws in his two outings since a fifth to star colt Loucasso. He is better served by the ace draw. MAURLEN BOY (11) draws widest but is hard to knock off back-to-back wins.",
